务。//Under the manager's direction, the company has developed an international reputation. 在经理的管理下，公司赢得了国际声誉。","ak":"ef72c37be9d1"},{"w":"director","p":"dɪˈrɛktɚ; daɪˈrɛktɚ","m":"n 指导者；理事；导演","k":"deputy director 副局长，副厅长；副院长；managing director n. 总经理，常务董事；vice director 副处长；副主任；副院长；副会长；executive director 执行理事；常务董事；director general 局长，处长","e":"The company is run by a board of directors (= a group of directors ) . 这家公司由董事会管理。","ak":"3d4e992d8d8a"},{"w":"dirty","p":"ˈdɝ​tɪ","m":"adj 脏的；下流的","k":"dirty water 脏水；dirty laundry 脏衣服；dirty air 污浊空气；dirty mark 污迹；dirty trick 卑鄙手段","e":"a stack of dirty dishes in the sink 洗涤槽里的一堆脏碟子","ak":"32478ef751ab"},{"w":"disable","p":"dɪs'ebl","m":"v 使无能，使伤残","e":"Carter was permanently disabled in the war. 卡特在那场战争中成了终生残废。","ak":"0aaa87422396"},{"w":"disadvantage","p":",dɪsəd'væntɪdʒ","m":"n 不利情况，缺点","k":"at a disadvantage 处于不利地位；to the disadvantage of adv. 对…不利；disadvantage factor 不利因素；不利因子","e":"Criminal behaviour can be linked to economic disadvantage. 犯罪行为可能会与经济困难有关。","ak":"225f143fa6a6"},{"w":"disagree","p":",dɪsə'ɡri","m":"v 有分歧；不一致","k":"disagree with 不同意；不一致；不适合；disagree on 对…持有不同看法；agree to disagree 消除分歧，求同存异；同意各自保留不同意见；disagree about 在…方面意见不统一；对…意见不一","e":"Barr strongly disagreed with Kronfeld’s statement. 巴尔强烈反对克龙费尔德的说法。","ak":"2b52ac64a552"},{"w":"disappoint","p":"ˌdisəˈpɔint","m":"vt. 失望，失信于；（希望等）破灭，挫败（计划等）","c":"情感观点","sub":"百家争鸣","e":"I'm sorry to disappoint you, but there aren't any tickets left. 很抱歉让你失望了，但是没有票了。// I'm sorry to disappoint your plans. 很抱歉妨碍了你的计划。","dec":"dis（不）+ap（加强）+point（点）→没有点到某人→使失望","r":"punct, point表示“点”","ak":"4c70e574b112"},{"w":"disappointing","p":",dɪsə'pɔɪntɪŋ","m":"adj 令人失望的","e":"disappointing profit figures 令人失望的盈利数字","ak":"154cc5fbf6c4"},{"w":"disapprove","p":"disə'pru：v","m":"【派】disapproval n.不赞成","dec":"dis（不）+approve（赞成）→不赞成","r":"prob, prov, proof表示“诚实，正直；证明”"},{"w":"disastrous","p":"diˈzɑːstrəs","m":"a. 灾难性的，造成灾害的；极坏的","s":"低频词汇","l":"List 30","j":"来自disaster（n. 灾难）","c":"世间百态","sub":"灾难与救援","e":"Climate change could have disastrous effects on the Earth. 气候的变化可能会给地球带来灾难性的影响。","ak":"ababe7e4a765"},{"w":"disclose","p":"dɪs'kloz","m":"v 揭开，揭发；透露","e":"Some companies have already voluntarily disclosed similar information . 一些公司已经主动透露了类似的信息。","ak":"a832319b2cd0"},{"w":"discord","p":"'diskɔ:d","m":"v.不和；不一致","dec":"dis（不）+cord（心）→心不齐→不和","r":"cord, cor表示“心，心脏”"},{"w":"discover","p":"disˈkʌvə","m":"vt. 发现，找到，发觉","c":"科技与环境","sub":"世界真奇妙","e":"The old lady suffered the double blow of losing her husband and discovering that she had cancer. 老妇人遭受了失去丈夫和被查出患有癌症的双重打击。","d":"discovery（n. 发现）","ak":"79bd2b6b389e"},{"w":"discovery","p":"dɪ'skʌvəri","m":"n 发现；被发现的事物","k":"scientific discovery 科学发现；discovery channel 探索频道；great discovery 伟大的发现；好棒的发现；discovery bay 愉景湾（位于香港大屿山东北部分）；发现湾（哥伦布第一脚踏上的土地）；discovery learning 发现学习","e":"I felt I'd made an incredible discovery. 我感到自己有了一个惊人的发现。","ak":"54818b05d116"},{"w":"discrete","p":"di'skri：t","m":"a.分离的，不连续的；不相关的","dec":"dis（加强）+cret（区别）+e→一定要加以区别→不相关的","r":"cern, cert, cret表示“搞清，区别”"},{"w":"discretion","p":"di'skreʃən","m":"n.谨慎；判定；考虑周到","dec":"dis（加强）+cret（区别）+ion（行为）→一定要谨慎地加以区别→谨慎","r":"cern, cert, cret表示“搞清，区别”"},{"w":"discrimination","p":"dɪ,skrɪmɪ'neʃən","m":"n 歧视","k":"racial discrimination 种族歧视；sex discrimination 性别歧视；雌雄鉴别；price discrimination 价格歧视，差别取价；gender discrimination 性别歧视；race discrimination 种族歧视","e":"laws to prevent discrimination 防止歧视的法律","ak":"974418acf6ac"},{"w":"discuss","p":"dɪ'skʌs","m":"v 讨论，谈论；论述","k":"discuss with 商洽；与…谈论","e":"Littman refused to discuss the case publicly. 利特曼拒绝公开讨论此案。","ak":"cb41ecf6e90a"},{"w":"discussion","p":"dɪ'skʌʃən","m":"n 讨论，谈论；论述","k":"under discussion 正在讨论中；group discussion 小组讨论；集体讨论；topic for discussion 议题；have a discussion 讨论一下，进行讨论；general discussion 一般讨论；交流区","e":"class discussions 课堂讨论","ak":"bd8bc36eb41b"},{"w":"dish","p":"dɪʃ","m":"n 碟，盘子；菜肴","k":"do the dishes 洗餐具；洗碗碟；chafing dish 火锅；保暖锅；main dish 主菜；主碟；dish out 给予，分发；dish up 起锅，分盛；把食物装盘，盛在盘中端上","e":"a serving dish 上菜用的盘子","ak":"d51f95cd19fe"},{"w":"dishonest","p":"dɪs'ɑnɪst","m":"adj 不诚实的","e":"dishonest traders 奸商","ak":"085e3b936a75"},{"w":"dishonour","p":"dɪs'ɑnɚ","m":"n 不光彩；丢脸的人","e":"I dare not quit my post, though an unfaithful sentinel, whose sure reward is death and dishonour, when his dreary watch shall come to an end! 虽说我是个不忠于职守的哨兵，等到这种沉网的守望终了的时候，我所能得到的报酬只能是不光彩的死亡，但我仍不敢擅离岗位！","ak":"97972ef991d5"},{"w":"dishwasher","p":"'dɪʃwɔʃɚ","m":"n 洗碗机","e":"I was a short-order cook and a dishwasher. 我曾是一名快餐厨师兼洗碗工。","ak":"a1515828e3ab"},{"w":"disk","p":"dɪsk","m":"n 圆盘，唱片；磁盘","k":"hard disk 硬盘；disk space [计]磁盘空间；disk drive n. 磁盘驱动器；floppy disk [计]软盘，软式磁碟片；hard disk drive 硬盘驱动器；硬碟机","e":"The program takes up 2.5 megabytes of disk space and can be run on a standard personal computer. 这个程序占用2.5 兆字节的磁盘空间，可以在标准个人电脑上运行。","ak":"75688b0220ad"},{"w":"disk/disc","p":"disk","m":"n. 唱片，磁盘；圆盘","j":"联想记忆：CD就是Compact Disk","c":"多彩生活","sub":"轻松MELODY","e":"You can't copy your file with this disk; it's full. 你不能用这张磁盘复制文件，它已经满了。//Most of the Jay's disks are popular with the youths. 杰伊的大部分唱片都受到年轻人的欢迎。","ak":"9cc9e5caf127"},{"w":"dislike","p":"disˈlaik","m":"vt. / n. 不喜爱，厌恶","j":"词根记忆：dis（不）＋like（喜欢）→厌恶","c":"情感观点","sub":"真情流露","e":"Why do you dislike her so much? 为什么你会如此讨厌她呢？","dec":"dis（不）+like（喜欢）→不喜欢","r":"dis-","core":1,"ak":"bc8b79025e45"},{"w":"disobey","p":"disə'bei","m":"v.不服从，违抗","dec":"dis（不）+obey（服从）→不服从","r":"dis-"},{"w":"disorderly","p":"dɪs'ɔrdɚli","m":"adj 杂乱的","k":"disorderly conduct 扰乱社会治安的行为，妨碍治安行为","e":"clothes left in a disorderly heap 乱七八糟堆在一起的衣服","ak":"fc08187feb2e"},{"w":"displease","p":"dɪs'pliz","m":"v 使不愉快，使生气","e":"If there are aspects of your life that displease you make you feel regret, this is an opportunity to change direction. 如果你生活中那些使你不愉快的方面让你觉得懊悔，那么这正是你改变方向的时机。","ak":"f8f03cf3a6b5"},{"w":"disruption","m":"n.分裂；瓦解","dec":"dis（分开）+rupt（断裂）+ion（状态）→使断裂→分裂[dis'rʌpʃən]","r":"rupt表示“破，断裂”"},{"w":"dissatisfy","p":"dɪs'sætɪs,fai","m":"v 不满意","e":"More or other, they still dissatisfy. 更多或另外一些，它们仍然不满足。","ak":"e0f6b7cb91ce"},{"w":"disservice","p":"dɪs'sɝvɪs","m":"n 伤害，帮倒忙","e":"He said the protesters were doing a disservice to the nation. 他表示，抗议者们的行为正对国家造成危害。","ak":"bca43e3e6547"},{"w":"dissimilar","p":"di'similə（r）","m":"【派】dissimilarity","dec":"dis（不）+simil（相类似）+ar（有……性质的）→不同的","r":"simil, sembl表示“相类似，一样”"},{"w":"dissimilation","p":"disimi'leiʃən","m":"n.异化；异化作用","dec":"dis（不）+simil（一样）+ation（行为）→使不一样→异化","r":"simil, sembl表示“相类似，一样”"},{"w":"distance","p":"'dɪstəns","m":"n 距离","k":"in the distance 在远处；long distance 长途电话局，长途通迅；at a distance 在远处；有相当距离；distance oneself from 使远离；使疏远；from a distance 从远处；隔开一段距离","e":"Measure the distance between the two points. 量出两点之间的距离。","ak":"a74ec9c5b688"},{"w":"distant","p":"ˈdistənt","m":"adj. 冷淡的，疏远的；在远处的，久远的","c":"形态体貌","sub":"物的特点","e":"Monica had a distant look in her eyes. 莫妮卡的眼神里透着冷漠。// the sound of distant gunfire 远处的炮火声","d":"distance（n. 距离；远方）","ak":"623c5a1c99ac"},{"w":"distinctive","p":"dɪ'stɪŋktɪv","m":"adj 独特的，与众不同的","k":"distinctive feature 辨别属性；区别性特征","e":"a rock band with a distinctive sound 音色独特的摇滚乐队","ak":"bcf0b8cbd070"},{"w":"distinguished","p":"dɪ'stɪŋgwɪʃt","m":"adj 显著的，杰出的","k":"be distinguished from 不同于……；与……加以区别；distinguished guest 嘉宾；上宾；尊贵的客人；be distinguished by 以…为特征；distinguished professor 特聘教授；be distinguished as 辨明为，称之为","e":"a long and distinguished career 漫长而卓越的职业生涯","ak":"3b40329f5b29"},{"w":"distract","p":"diˈstrækt","m":"vt. 转移注意力，分散；迷惑，扰乱","s":"低频词汇","l":"List 30","j":"词根记忆：dis（分开）＋tract（拉）→（注意力）被拉开→转移注意力","e":"Try not to distract the other students. 尽量不要让其他学生分心。","ak":"fff7580a27d6"},{"w":"distracted","p":"dɪ'stræktɪd","m":"adj 分心的","k":"distract from 转移；使从…分心","e":"She had seemed curiously distracted. 她不知为什么显得心不在焉。","ak":"6fa18de65246"},{"w":"distraction","p":"dɪ'strækʃən","m":"n 消遣；分心","e":"I study in the library as there are too many distractions at home. 我在图书馆学习，家里分心的事太多。","ak":"0c087fbef1ed"},{"w":"distribute","p":"diˈstribjuːt","m":"vt. 分发，分配；使分布，散布","c":"经济发展","sub":"商　业","e":"Milk has been distributed to the local shops. 牛奶已经分发到当地商店。//This species of bird is widely distributed throughout the world. 这个品种的鸟类广泛地分布在世界各地。","d":"distribution（n. 分发，分送）；distributed（a. 分布式的）； distributor（n. 发行人）","dec":"dis（分散）+tribute（给予）→分散给予→分配","r":"tribut, tribute表示“给予”","core":1,"ak":"8738eb91d5c8"},{"w":"district","p":"'dɪstrɪkt","m":"n 区","k":"business district 商务区；urban district 市区；district government 地区政府；residential district 居住区；district court （美）州地方法院","e":"a postal district 邮政区","ak":"6b77ef4b6028"},{"w":"dive","p":"daiv","m":"n./vi. 跳水，潜水；俯冲，扑","k":"dive into 跳入","c":"多彩生活","sub":"轻松MELODY","e":"Throw your arms out in front of you as you dive. 跳水时手臂前伸。//What a beautiful dive! 多么优美的跳水！","d":"diver（n. 潜水者）","ak":"b9f5bcd98fe1"},{"w":"diversity","p":"dɪˈvəsɪti","m":"n 多样性；差异","k":"species diversity 物种多样性；歧异度；biological diversity 生物多样性；生物差异；diversity index 多样性指数；歧异度指数；diversity gain 分集增益；frequency diversity 频率分隔","e":"...the cultural diversity of Latin America. …拉丁美洲文化的多样性。","ak":"97081c161135"},{"w":"divine","p":"diˈvain","m":"a. 神的，神授的，天赐的；极好的，极美的","s":"低频词汇","l":"List 30","e":"divine power 神的力量","ak":"67d46ec7d84b"},{"w":"do","p":"du","m":"aux v；v 做，干，办","k":"do a [口语]仿效，模仿，学…的样子；do well 做得好；进展好；do so 如此做；do in 使精疲力竭；do right 做得对","e":"‘Will Kay come?’ ‘She may do.’ “凯来吗？” “或许吧。”","ak":"d4579b2688d6"},{"w":"dock","p":"dɔk","m":"n. 码头，船埠；（法庭的）被告席 v. （船）靠码头；扣（工资等）","s":"低频词汇","l":"List 30","j":"联想记忆：清晨的码头（dock），一群小鸭子（duck）在戏水","e":"A crowd was waiting at the dock to greet them. 一群人在码头等着迎接他们。","ak":"05debdb8b38c"},{"w":"doctor","p":"'dɑktɚ","m":"n 医生，医师；博士","e":"She was treated by her local doctor. 她由她的本区医生治疗。","ak":"f9f16d97c90d"},{"w":"doctoral","p":"'dɔktərəl","m":"adj  博士的","k":"doctoral student 博士生；doctoral degree 博士学位；doctoral dissertation 博士论文；doctoral candidate 博士研究生","e":"a doctoral thesis 博士论文","ak":"8820d936e2e9"},{"w":"dog","p":"dɔɡ","m":"n 狗，犬，犬科动物","k":"let sleeping dogs lie [口语]莫惹是非，别惹麻烦，不自找麻烦；别多事[亦作 don't wake a sleeping dog]；little dog n. [天]小犬座（等于Canis Minor）；hot dog 热狗（面包夹熏红肠）；pet dog 宠物狗；宠物犬；dog food 狗食；一文不值，分文不值","e":"I could hear a dog barking . 我听到了狗吠声。","ak":"06d80eb0c50b"},{"w":"dollar","p":"'dɑlɚ","m":"n 元(货币单位)","k":"us dollar 美元；hong kong dollar 港元；dollar bill 美元钞票；australian dollar 澳币；silver dollar 银元","e":"It cost three dollars. 它要三美元。","ak":"33c381af2d1e"},{"w":"domination","p":",dɑmə'neʃən","m":"n 主导","e":"The imperialists use this ideology and culture as a lever for easily realizing their domination and subjugation, aggression and plunder of other countries.  帝国主义者使用这种思想和文化作为一种杠杆，轻易地实现其统治、征服、侵略以及掠夺他国的目的。","ak":"59d7bbe19dfe"},{"w":"donate","p":"dəuˈneit; ˈdəuneit","m":"vt. 捐赠，赠送","s":"低频词汇","l":"List 30","j":"词根记忆：don（给予）＋ate（做）→给出去→捐赠，赠送","k":"donate sth. to sb./sth. 将某物赠与某人或某事物","c":"世间百态","sub":"灾难与救援","e":"The concert organizers say they will donate all profits to charity. 音乐会的筹办者说他们将全部的利润捐赠给慈善机构。","d":"donation（n. 捐款，捐赠物）","dec":"don（给予）+ate（使……）→给出去→捐赠","r":"don, dos, dot, dit表示“给予”","ak":"6c62058ab695"},{"w":"donor","p":"'dəvnə（r）","m":"n.捐献者，赠送者","dec":"don（给予）+or（人）→给予的人→捐献者","r":"don, dos, dot, dit表示“给予”"},{"w":"door","p":"dɔr","m":"n 门，通道；一家","k":"at the door 在门边；open the door 开门；next door n. 隔壁邻居；door to door 挨家挨户；门到门；front door n. 前门","e":"Could you open the door for me? 请你帮我开门好吗？","ak":"2feaaf89c217"},{"w":"double","p":"'dʌbl","m":"adj 两倍的；双的","k":"double layer 双层；double room 双人房；double deck n. 楼中楼；双层甲板；double star 双星（紧密相连的二颗星，借望远镜始可分辨者）；double bed 双人床","e":"a double sink 双水槽","ak":"e8cd7da078a8"},{"w":"doubt","p":"daʊt","m":"n 怀疑；疑虑；v 怀疑","k":"no doubt adv. 无疑地；很可能地；in doubt 可怀疑的；不能肯定的；there is no doubt 毫无疑问；without doubt 无疑地；确实地；doubt about v. 怀疑","e":"There was still one little nagging doubt at the back of his mind. 他的心头仍有一丝挥之不去的疑虑。","ak":"4a6cbcd66d27"},{"w":"doubtless","p":"'daʊtləs","m":"adv 无疑地；很可能","e":"Doubtless there would be lots of rumours. 无疑会谣言四起。","ak":"f896a02daf8c"},{"w":"down","p":"daʊn","m":"adv 向下，在下面","k":"down on 突然意识到；go down 下降；平静下来；传下去；被接受；down with 打倒；把…拿下；ups and downs n. 沉浮；盛衰；高低；down through 在整个…的时间里","e":"David bent down to tie his shoelace. 戴维弯腰系鞋带。","ak":"74e8333ad116"},{"w":"downfall","p":"'daʊnfɔl","m":"n （雨等的）大下特下"},{"w":"downgrade","p":"'davngreid","m":"v.贬低，降低；n.下坡","dec":"down（向下）+grad（级别）+e→级别向下倒退→贬低","r":"grad, gredi, gress表示“走；等级，度”"},{"w":"download","p":",daʊn'lod","m":"v 下载","k":"download link 下载链接；download center 下载中心；download now 立即下载；music download 音乐下载","e":"games that can be downloaded free from the Internet 可以从因特网上免费下载的游戏","ak":"fd456406745d"},{"w":"downsize","p":"'daʊnsaɪz","m":"v 裁员","e":"The airline has downsized its workforce by 30%. 这家航空公司裁员30%。","ak":"b37bc3910d3d"},{"w":"downstairs","p":"'daʊn'stɛrz","m":"adv 在楼下；adj 楼下的","k":"go downstairs 下楼","e":"Rosie ran downstairs to answer the door. 罗茜跑下楼去开门。","ak":"e056ec84dfbb"},{"w":"dozen","p":"'dʌzn","m":"n 一打，十二个","k":"dozens of 几十；许多；by the dozen 成打地；按打计算；half a dozen adj. 半打，六个；a dozen eggs 一打鸡蛋；daily dozen 每日健身操；例行公事","e":"a dozen eggs 一打鸡蛋","ak":"947f37f1ebd5"},{"w":"draft/draught","p":"drɑːft; dræft","m":"n. 草稿，草案；汇票；征兵，服役；通风，气流 vt. 起草；征召…入伍","c":"人文社会","sub":"笑看沉浮","e":"a rough drafi 草稿//a draft system 征兵制//My dad was eighteen when he got drafted into the army. 爸爸18岁时被征召入伍。","d":"redraft（v. 改写）；updraft（n. 上升气流）；draftee（n. 应征入伍者）","ak":"830bf298a84d"},{"w":"drag","p":"dræɡ","m":"vt. 拖，拉；迫使，硬拉 vi. 拖着脚步走；拖延 n. 障碍；一吸","j":"联想记忆：和drug（n. 药物；毒品）一起记","k":"drag on / out （使）拖延；drag sth. out 将某物拖出；drag sb. to 拉某人去","c":"包罗万象","sub":"包罗万象","e":"Mom dragged us to a classical music concert. 妈妈硬拉我们去听古典音乐会。// The party was a drag, so we left early. 聚会开得单调乏味，所以我们提早走了。","ak":"9fa45db736cf"},{"w":"dramatically","p":"drə'mætɪkli","m":"adv 戏剧性地，引人注目地"},{"w":"draught","p":"drɑft","m":"n 穿堂风，冷风；adj 〔啤酒〕桶装的，散装的","k":"draught fan 通风风扇；引风机；通风机；draught animals 挽畜；draught beer 生啤酒","e":"Can you close the window? I’m in a draught . 你把窗户关上好吗？我正对着风口。","ak":"edfc3310282b"},{"w":"draw","p":"drɔː","m":"vt. 画，描绘；拖；拨出；提取；吸引；推断出 vi. （向某方向）移动；打成平局；得到 n. 平局；抽签","k":"draw near 临近，来临；draw on 利用；临近；draw up 起草；（使）停住；draw in （天）渐黑，（白昼）渐短；（汽车或火车）到站","c":"人文社会","sub":"智慧结晶","e":"to draw a picture 画一幅画//As we all know, plants draw nourishment from the soil. 众所周知，植物从土壤中汲取养分。//As the night drew on, the world became quite gradually peaceful. 随着夜晚的来临，世界渐渐安静下来。","ak":"817491bc7777"},{"w":"drawing","p":"'drɔɪŋ","m":"n 图画，素描；绘图","k":"drawing up 拟订；drawing process 回火过程；deep drawing 深冲压，深拉；in drawing 画得精确；wire drawing 拔丝；抽丝现象","e":"I’ve never been very good at drawing. 我向来不擅长画图。","ak":"d8eb87629476"},{"w":"dread","p":"drɛd","m":"n 畏惧；恐怖；v 惧怕","k":"dread lord 暗黑之主（游戏中任务名称）","e":"The prospect of flying filled me with dread . 想到要乘飞机我充满了恐惧。","ak":"d74827ee76d4"},{"w":"dream","p":"drim","m":"n 梦；梦想；v 做梦","k":"dream of 梦想；梦见；have a dream 做梦；like a dream 毫不费力地；轻而易举地；完美地；dream come true 梦想成真；美梦成真；dream about 梦想；梦到","e":"I had lots of dreams last night. 昨晚我做了很多梦。","ak":"8812662dcf3e"},{"w":"dress","p":"drɛs","m":"n 女服，童装；服装","k":"dress oneself 打扮；给自己穿衣服；dress up v. 打扮，装饰；穿上盛装；dress in （使）穿…的服装；乔装打扮；wedding dress 结婚礼服；dress for 为…而打扮","e":"a gentleman in evening dress 穿晚礼服的绅士","ak":"ccaaac957ec3"},{"w":"drink","p":"drɪŋk","m":"v 饮；v 喝；n 饮料","k":"drink in 吸收；drink water 喝水，饮水；something to drink n. 喝的东西；一些喝的东西；drink tea 喝茶；drink coffee 喝咖啡","e":"You should drink plenty of water. 你应该大量喝水。","ak":"0b18a3d7b9c4"},{"w":"drive","p":"draiv","m":"vt. 驾驶；用车送；把（钉、桩等）打入；驱赶；迫使 vi. 驾驶 n. 驾驶；车行道；运动；干劲","k":"drive at 想说，打算","c":"多彩生活","sub":"畅通NONSTOP","e":"Why don't you drive to work? 你为什么不开车上班？//Phil, driven by jealousy, started spying on his wife. 菲尔在嫉妒心的驱使下开始监视自己的妻子。//I wish I knew what they were really driving at. 我希望知道他们真正的意图。","ak":"4aa1e7414849"},{"w":"driver","p":"'draɪvɚ","m":"n 驾驶员，司机","k":"taxi driver 出租车司机；的士司机；bus driver 公交车司机；device driver 设备驱动程序；truck driver 卡车司机；motor driver 汽车司机；马达驱动器；电动驱动器","e":"a taxi driver 出租车司机","ak":"e2d45d57c7e2"},{"w":"drop","p":"drɔp","m":"vt. （使）下降，（使）降低；（使）停止，放弃 n. 下降，下降（或下落）的距离；微量，一点点","k":"drop